steps.step:
Add a PreviewThisCommand class (MenuItemHandler subclass) in
xshrowviewer.cpp that implements execute() with:
  int currentFrame = TApp::instance()->getCurrentFrame()->getFrame();
  int r0, r1, step;
  XsheetGUI::getPlayRange(r0, r1, step);
  XsheetGUI::setPlayRange(currentFrame, currentFrame, step);
Register it at file scope with static initialization.
